What:		/sys/kernel/ashmem/
Date:		Feb 2025
Contact:	Alice Ryhl <aliceryhl@google.com>
Description:
		/sys/kernel/ashmem/ contains a single node that can be used
		to adjust different characteristics of the ashmem driver's
		behavior.

What:		/sys/kernel/ashmem/unpinning_enable
Date:		Feb 2025
Contact:	Alice Ryhl <aliceryhl@google.com>
Description:
		Determines whether the ASHMEM_UNPIN ioctl can be used.

		If the value is set to 1, then unpinned pages may be freed by a
		shrinker if the system is under memory pressure. Otherwise,
		unpinning a page has no effect.
